 Letter | Sending a Large Letter | Evri","Here at Evri, we don't just handle standard parcels. You can also post large letters and small packets with our Couriers straight through the letter box.","postable.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpostable",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","c1e7d999-2a5f-489e-a325-50299c6cc8d8",false,{"link_type":18},[23,45,87,127,158,177,190,209],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":36,"id":42,"slice_type":43,"slice_label":44},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{"contentRight":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","576cf78c-6442-44c7-811e-01e6357024df",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Sending a large letter",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$b35f2b45-9265-4317-b2ed-4bde9f60e4de","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":85,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":44},"cardWithImageNoCta",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":63,"CardText":64,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,665,"An Evri Courier delivering a postable parcel into the mailbox of a block of flats","postable.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3791.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C141%2C7650%2C5087&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},0,141,1,"transparent","none","Post a large letter with Evri",[65,69,73,76,79,82],{"type":66,"text":67,"spans":68},"paragraph","Looking for a letter Courier to handle your letterbox-friendly parcels and packets? We make it easy to send parcels of this size with our Courier Collection service, ParcelShops, and Lockers. This includes any items that are:",[],{"type":70,"text":71,"spans":72},"list-item","Up to 23cm wide",[],{"type":70,"text":74,"spans":75},"Up to 35cm long",[],{"type":70,"text":77,"spans":78},"Between 1cm and 3cm in depth",[],{"type":70,"text":80,"spans":81},"Between 250g and 1kg in weight",[],{"type":66,"text":83,"spans":84},"So, whether you need to send anything that could fit through a letterbox – like books, small toys, games, or stationery – our letter Courier Service can handle it all!",[],"card$0e8124fd-50a8-4907-9896-0d69c9844c83","card",{"variation":88,"version":25,"items":89,"primary":118,"id":125,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":44},"3ColumnTable",[90,94,98,101,105,109,113,116],{"Col1Content":91,"Col2Content":92,"Col3Content":93},"Standard delivery to ParcelShop","£2.62","✘",{"Col1Content":95,"Col2Content":96,"Col3Content":97},"Standard delivery to home\u002Fbusiness","£2.70","£2.70*",{"Col1Content":99,"Col2Content":100,"Col3Content":93},"Next Day delivery to ParcelShop","£3.20",{"Col1Content":102,"Col2Content":103,"Col3Content":104},"Next Day delivery to home\u002Fbusiness","£3.29","£3.50",{"Col1Content":106,"Col2Content":107,"Col3Content":108},"Max height x length x depth (cm)","23 x 35 x 3","25 x 35.3 x 2.5",{"Col1Content":110,"Col2Content":111,"Col3Content":112},"Max weight","1kg","750g",{"Col1Content":114,"Col2Content":115,"Col3Content":115},"Free tracking?","✔",{"Col1Content":117,"Col2Content":115,"Col3Content":115},"Print labels in-store?",{"SectionTitle":119,"SectionSubtitle":120,"Col1Header":121,"Col2Header":122,"Col3Header":123,"TableFooter":124,"isTableShort":20},"See where we’re cheaper than Royal Mail","With our Couriers, we’ll always try to provide you with low delivery prices, so you know you’re never spending more than you have to when sending with us. See how we compare to Royal Mail below:","Postable \u002F Large letter delivery","Evri","Royal Mail","(*Based on Tracked Large Letter weighing 750g services)","information_table$9fd5dc27-9af1-4170-866f-7ee86f6669b5","information_table",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":128,"primary":130,"id":157,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":44},[129],{},{"CardImage":131,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":138,"CardText":139,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":132,"alt":133,"copyright":44,"url":134,"id":135,"edit":136},{"width":52,"height":53},"An older woman is wrapping a parcel. She is applying the label to her parcel with tape.","postable.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ow2JbqstJ9-cVK_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10360.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6ow2JbqstJ9-cVK",{"x":58,"y":137,"zoom":60,"background":61},8,"How to post a larger letter",[140,144],{"type":66,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":143},"No matter where you’re sending a larger letter, we offer you two quick and easy options to get it on its way.  Book your Postable parcel with one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers.",[],"ltr",{"type":66,"text":145,"spans":146,"direction":143},"And whichever option you choose, it’s super quick and convenient to send your parcel with us by using our website or our app. You can even print out your label at home or in one of our ParcelShops with our free Print in ParcelShop devices.",[147,155],{"start":148,"end":149,"type":150,"data":151},117,124,"hyperlink",{"link_type":152,"url":153,"target":154},"Web","postable.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fmobile-app","_blank",{"start":148,"end":149,"type":156},"strong","card$071a04d9-75c1-4345-b08e-679ae709ed64",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":159,"primary":161,"id":176,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":44},[160],{},{"CardImage":162,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":168,"CardText":169,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":163,"alt":164,"copyright":44,"url":165,"id":166,"edit":167},{"width":52,"height":53},"A mother is sealing a parcel bag on her coffee table. Her two children are watching a tablet on the sofa behind her","postable.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc9ZbqstJ9-inU_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7643.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zc9ZbqstJ9-inU",{"x":58,"y":137,"zoom":60,"background":61},"How to weigh and pack a large letter",[170,173],{"type":66,"text":171,"spans":172},"To make sure that your large letter remains within our size and weight limitations, it’s always best to weigh and measure your package before sending it.",[],{"type":66,"text":174,"spans":175},"First, you’ll want to buy a hardback envelope or cardboard sleeve that fits within our size limitations, to keep your letter’s contents safe. You’ll then need to weigh it once you’ve packed your item. To do this, we recommend using a set of digital scales – kitchen scales are ideal – in order to accurately weigh your large letter or postable parcel. If it’s 1kg or less, it’s ready to be sent.",[],"card$7fc840df-1edd-4446-a4dd-83c7c0b80030",{"variation":178,"version":25,"items":179,"primary":181,"id":189,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":44},"cardNoImageWithCta",[180],{},{"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":182,"CardText":183,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":187,"IsEco":20},"How to save money when sending large letters",[184],{"type":66,"text":185,"spans":186},"Although we keep our delivery prices as low as possible for postable parcels, you should always be sure to weigh your parcel correctly before sending it. The price you pay will be based on your parcel’s weight, so by double-checking it before booking a delivery, you can be sure that you’re only pay what you send.",[],{"link_type":188},"Any","card$65ea21d9-16c6-4fd8-af89-531e8cf8c974",{"variation":191,"version":25,"items":192,"primary":193,"id":207,"slice_type":208,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[],{"title":194,"bodyText":195,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":38,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":44,"buttonLink":199,"image":200},"Are you VAT registered?",[196],{"type":66,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":143},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":188},{"dimensions":201,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":203,"id":204,"edit":205},{"width":52,"height":202},667,"postable.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":206,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},2,"feature_banner$1acf1f51-53d5-47d2-a553-f9c2ff2cb2b4","feature_banner",{"variation":178,"version":25,"items":210,"primary":212,"id":222,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":44},[211],{},{"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":213,"CardText":214,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":221,"IsEco":20},"Large letter parcel cover",[215,218],{"type":66,"text":216,"spans":217},"While we do offer free parcel cover up to £20 on parcels weighing 1kg or more, as well as additional cover should you need it, this does not extend to our large letters and postable parcels.",[],{"type":66,"text":219,"spans":220},"That’s why we recommend ensuring that your envelope or packaging is as protected as possible. Use heavy-duty tape to secure its edges and add additional bubble wrap protection inside if need be – especially if the item you’re sending is delicate.",[],{"link_type":188},"card$3c52e27a-367c-4b06-a6db-1c78f41a5da7",[23,45,87,127,158,177,190,209],{"heroCardContent":225},[226],{"id":29,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":30,"href":227,"tags":228,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"slugs":229,"linked_documents":230,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":231,"data":232},"postable.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[32],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":233,"heading":